B.aXZ=new A.J(B.v,["The image shows only your marked provinces and their count \u2014 they show where you have been. No dates, stop names or device location.","G\xf6rselde yaln\u0131z i\u015faretledi\u011fin iller ve say\u0131s\u0131 var; bu iller nerelere gitti\u011fini g\xf6sterir. Tarih, durak ad\u0131 ve cihaz konumu yer almaz."],t.w)
